hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"342","A chapter on what is said at the conquest: Hannad ibn al-Sari narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Ubayd narrated to us, from Hilal ibn Salman; I heard al-Sha'bi saying: When (When the help of Allah and victory come) was revealed, whenever a conquest was granted to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) he would say: Glory be to Allah, praise be to Allah, I turn to Allah and seek His forgiveness."
